ady Graphics Card, 1920 Core, 1506MHz GPU, 1683MHz Boost                 \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":267,"row":{"pair_id":"7083643#8251132","label":0,"id_left":7083643,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":9811283,"brand_left":"\"Apple\"@en","title_left":" \"Apple Mac Mini 1.4GHz Intel Core i5 Computer\"@en Computer - MGEM2LL/A\"@en","description_left":"\"1.4GHz Dual-Core Intel Core i5 (Turbo Boost Up To 2.7GHz)/ 3MB L3 Cache/ 500GB 5400rpm Hard Drive/ 4GB Of 1600MHz LPDDR3 Memory/ Intel HD Graphics 5000/ Thunderbolt 2/ USB 3/ SDXC Card Slot/ HDMI/ 802.11ac/ Bluetooth 4.0/ Aluminum Finish\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Method Estimated Delivery Cost Ground Shipping Nov 27th $10.24 Second Day Nov 24th $17.41 Next Day Air Nov 22nd $35.92 Processor Speed 1.40GHz System Memory (RAM) 4GB Hard Drive Size 500GB Graphics Card Intel HD Graphics Device Type Mac Mini    ","id_right":8251132,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":5906557,"brand_right":"\"Apple\"@en","title_right":" \"Apple Mac Mini 2.3GHz Intel Core i5 Computer\"@en Computer - MC815LL/A Abt\"@en","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":268,"row":{"pair_id":"8163032#15301739","label":1,"id_left":8163032,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":1942389,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"ASUS SABERTOOTH X99 - motherboard ATX LGA2011-v3 Socket X99\" \" ASUS SABERTOOTHX99 Motherboards/Chassis CDW.com","description_left":"\"Designed to break performance barriers, ASUS OC Socket utilizes extra pins to connect a proprietary circuit to contacts found on Haswell-E's land grid array (LGA). This feature enables higher DDR4 memory frequencies, lower latencies and enhanced stability while overclocking, extending all the way to extreme overclocking conditions, such as Liquid Nitrogen (LN2). Cache bus links areas such as CPU cores, DDR4 Memory Controllers, System Agent and the shared L3 Cache. It is a critical interconnect for the whole CPU subsystem. Higher cache bus frequency directly gives faster total sub-system performance. ASUS OC Socket exclusively provides an adjustable cache bus voltage to reach higher cache bus frequencies.This is a platform to support DDR4 memory and it's able to drive memory frequencies to 3200MHz (and beyond when overclocked)! ASUS-exclusive T-Topology circuit design plus OC Socket provides superb memory-overclocking capability to unleash the full power of DDR4 by minimizing coupling noise and signal reflection. More than just a cool military-styled cover, TUF Thermal Armor employs the fan to provide boosted airflow for rapid cooling. The special heat pipes accelerate dissipation from critical components and make sure temperatures stay low across the board. SABERTOOTH X99 Thermal Armor can reduce the temperature by up to 10Â°C!SABERTOOTH X99 Thermal Radar 2 now has up to 11 fan connectors to let you control fans as many as you want. Moreover, Multiple onboard sensors and the bundled thermistor cable let you monitor graphics card temperatures and other key components in real time, so you can adjust manually or optimize automatically with one click.\" ","price_left":"\"$\", \"349.99\"","specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":15301739,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":390554,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"ASUS SABERTOOTH X99 USB 3.1 Motherboard\"@en Motherboard LN64186 - 90MB0L00-M0EAY0 | SCAN UK\"@en","description_right":"\"ASUS SABERTOOTH X99, Intel X99, S 2011-3, DDR4, SATA III 6Gb/s, RAID, PCIe 3.0 (x16), Quad SLi/CrossFireX, USB 3.1, ATX  \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":269,"row":{"pair_id":"264005#3178643","label":0,"id_left":264005,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":9312234,"brand_left":"\"Null\"","title_left":" \"App