 altavoces + subwoofer JBL, Batería 4 celdas, Windows 10 Home 64-bit, color negro\"@es ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11005701,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":3967773,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Asus P541UJ-GO626T i7-7500u 12GB 1TB Nvidia GT920 2GB 15.6 W10 Chocolate\"@es \"Black Friday 2017 | Megacomponentes.com informática y tecnología\"@es","description_right":"\"\nIntel® Core i7-7500U 2 Núcleos, 4M Cache, 2.7GHz\nMemoria RAM 12GB DDR4\n1TB Disco Duro SATA 6GB/s a 5400rpm\nGraficos Nvidia Geforce GT920 de 2GB\n15.6\" Pantalla LED\nWindows 10 Home a 64bits\n\"@es ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":286,"row":{"pair_id":"11889939#11057856","label":0,"id_left":11889939,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":13171321,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Gigabyte BSI5-6200 BRIX Ultra Compact Mini PC with mDP/HDMI 1.4 and USB 3.0\"@en 3.0 LN69906 - GB-BSI5-6200 | SCAN UK\"@en","description_left":"\"Gigabyte Brix Ultra Compact PC, Dual Core i5-6200u CPU, Intel HD Graphics, M.2 Slot, DDR3L, mDP/HDMI 1.4a, 4x USB 3.0    \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11057856,"category_right":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":293512,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Gigabyte Bace 3150 Ultra Compact PC Kit with HDMI and USB 3.0\"@en 3.0 LN70191 - GB-BACE-3150 | SCAN UK\"@en","description_right":"\"Gigabyte GB-BACE-3150, Intel N3150 Quad Core CPU, System-on-Chip, DDR3L, Intel HD Graphics, HDMI/VGA, MicroSD, USB 3.0   \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":287,"row":{"pair_id":"6784173#14263409","label":1,"id_left":6784173,"category_left":"Computers_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":409402,"brand_left":"\"Intel\"@en","title_left":" \"Intel Core i7-6700K 4.0GHz (Skylake) Socket LGA1151 Processor - Retail\"@en \"▷ Intel Processo… | OcUK\"@en","descriptio